msgstr "Weblate scanner nu lageret. Vent venligst."

msgid ""
"Notification settings removed, please do not forget to save the changes."
msgstr "Notifikationsindstillinger fjernet - husk at gemme ændringerne."

msgctxt "Alert to user when opening browser developer console"
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr "Stop!"

msgid ""
"This is a browser feature intended for developers. If someone told you to "
"copy-paste something here, they are likely trying to compromise your Weblate "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Dette er en browserfunktion beregnet til udviklere. Hvis nogen beder dig at "
"indsætte noget her, forsøger de sandsynligvis at kompromittere din Weblate-"
"konto."

msgid "See https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Self-XSS for more information."
msgstr "Se flere oplysninger på https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Self-XSS."

